{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a single-modal RNA-only baseline with pca_n2000 encoding, achieving 0.4849 validation accuracy and 0.4639 F1 score. The performance is lower than multimodal setups (e.g., 0.5266 accuracy) but lacks direct comparison to other single-modal baselines, leaving uncertainty about whether this RNA-only configuration represents the optimal single-modal approach or if multimodal integration provides meaningful gains."
}

